  "note": "Recto page given over almost entirely to the Example 1.4 worked-example panel, single column. The grey panel measures [0.1135, 0.1377, 0.6865, 0.9371] and its interior samples #dbdcde (the same panel grey as p007 and p010, and NOT the #d1d2d4 of the running-header panel); A2 cuts its contents into fifteen alternating blocks - eight `box` prose blocks (n=1,2,4,6,8,10,12,14) and seven displayed equations (n=3,5,7,9,11,13,15) - so each element carries the panel's #dbdcde fill and its own band of the panel. Equation bboxes are taller than a text line because of stacked fractions and the tall absolute-value brackets. The panel's plain cyan #00adef bar is on the inner (left) edge, recorded as decorative_image, and the wide cyan label bar carrying 'EXAMPLE 1.4' in white sideways type is on the outer (right) edge at x 0.696-0.738, recorded as major_heading - the same arrangement as p007. The outer margin holds a 'PHYSICS' roundel (decorative_image) above block n=16, a sideways marginal note whose URL is cyan #00adef. Panel prose is about 0.9x body. No footer_rule. Folio '13' in a pale cyan box in the outer margin; '2022-23' recorded as running_header."
